{"app":"spr-flow","version":3,"nodes":[{"id":"note","type":"info","position":{"x":-858,"y":-496},"data":{"title":"Guided-mode resonance filter","text":"TiO₂ / air grating on BK7 at normal incidence (TE). A leaky waveguide mode gives a narrow reflection peak near λ ≈ Λ·n_eff.\n\nThe optimizer (Nelder-Mead) adjusts the period, the fill factor and the depth so that R is high at 598–602 nm and low elsewhere (Zones). Compute RCWA uses 8 orders to stay fast during the optimization; check the result with more orders afterwards. After Start, the Plot and the View Grating on the right show the optimized filter (Optimization Engine outputs).","color":"#8a93a6","width":360,"height":260}},{"id":"air","type":"material","position":{"x":-858,"y":-142},"data":{"materialId":"Air","color":"#f4f6fa","indexMode":"absolute","porosity":{"$num":"NaN"}}},{"id":"tio2","type":"material","position":{"x":-858,"y":94},"data":{"materialId":"TiO2","color":"#f2f0e6","indexMode":"absolute","porosity":{"$num":"NaN"}}},{"id":"bk7","type":"material","position":{"x":-858,"y":330},"data":{"materialId":"BK7","color":"#9fc9e6","indexMode":"absolute","porosity":{"$num":"NaN"}}},{"id":"vp","type":"variable","position":{"x":-1274,"y":-71},"data":{"name":"period","value":360,"min":300,"max":420,"integer":false}},{"id":"vf","type":"variable","position":{"x":-1274,"y":177},"data":{"name":"fill","value":0.5,"min":0.2,"max":0.8,"integer":false}},{"id":"vd","type":"variable","position":{"x":-1274,"y":425},"data":{"name":"depth","value":120,"min":60,"max":200,"integer":false}},{"id":"gr","type":"grating","position":{"x":-442,"y":-71},"data":{"label":"TiO₂ grating","profile":"lamellar","period":360,"thickness":120,"fill":0.5,"fillTop":0.3,"shift":0.5,"slices":10,"nx":32,"pixels":[],"materials":2}},{"id":"stack","type":"combine","position":{"x":78,"y":71},"data":{"name":"GMR filter","count":1}},{"id":"wl","type":"param","position":{"x":78,"y":-260},"data":{"quantity":"lambda","mode":"range","value":600,"min":540,"max